Each cost annotation form reports its exact sub-cent residual.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['^Expenses:Rounding'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash
account Expenses:Rounding
2024-01-01 Unit lot cost
  Assets:Fund  1.234 FUND {2.00 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -2.47 SEK
2024-01-02 Unit transaction price
  Assets:Fund  1.234 FUND @ 2.00 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -2.47 SEK
2024-01-03 Total lot cost
  Assets:Fund  1.234 FUND {{2.468 SEK}}
  Assets:Cash  -2.47 SEK
2024-01-04 Total transaction price
  Assets:Fund  1.234 FUND @@ 2.468 SEK
  Assets:Cash  -2.47 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[MISSING_DEFAULT_COMMODITY] Journal must declare one default commodity
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:1:1

[UNBALANCED_TRANSACTION] Transaction does not balance: -0.002 SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:8:1
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:11:1
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:14:1
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:17:1
